      },
      "displayName": "Bill Branan",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5d83b5f927bbf40c2c32ceeb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>For discussion purposes, these are the methods currently in the REST API which provide a .xml shortcut</p>\n\n<p>getObjectHistory (no problem possible)<br/>\nExample: /objects/demo:29/versions.xml</p>\n\n<p>getObjectProfile (possible problem if PID ends in .xml)<br/>\nExample: /objects/demo:29.xml</p>\n\n<p>listDatastreams (no problem possible)<br/>\nExample: /objects/demo:35/datastreams.xml</p>\n\n<p>listMethods (no problem possible)<br/>\nExample: /objects/demo:29/methods.xml</p>\n\n<p>getDatastream (known problem if DSID ends in .xml)<br/>\nExample: /objects/demo:29/datastreams/myDatastream.xml</p>\n\n<p>getNextPID (no problem possible)<br/>\nExample: /objects/nextPID.xml</p>",
     "created": "20/Oct/09 2:57 PM",
     "id": "11034",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10515/comment/11034",
