     "body": "<p>Steve, I decided to take on \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-556\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-556\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Implement REST method/service invocation (was: getDissemination)\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-556\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n.  Looking at the rest package now, I see exactly what needs to address this one too.  If you haven't started this yet I'd be happy to take it off your hands...</p>",
