     "body": "<p>Chris - no, I haven't yet started work on this, makes sense for you to pick that up if you've spotted what needs to be done.  I've also assigned \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-522\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-522\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"DSIDs can now no longer terminate in .xml and behave properly\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-522\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n to you (was also me) as it's effectively the same.</p>",
